<title>USA: Tuscaloosa Cty BOE, Ala., won by JC Bradford.</title>
<headline>Tuscaloosa Cty BOE, Ala., won by JC Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>JC Bradford &amp; Co said it won $9 million of Tuscaloosa County Board of Education, Ala., capital outlay limited tax warrants, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 5.462 percent.</p>
</text>
